      "content": "but it's not just exhaustion. it's like... i've tried every therapy, every coping thing, every \"small step\" you're talking about. it's like trying to patch a shattered vase with tape. it's just fundamentally ruined. i don't see how \"fixing\" it is even possible anymore.",
